g_IJHZMGgQ7kNvwFu7-CP&_nc_oc=AdpLYu7FjkbX-G8AngWtQSuDaF6rKfN2uU17i36FYi2PTEL6_LfQbsmaGofbd1DVgwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6paWjEIbpMSbnvIo3VN6Kz3J_dF7cZrk5kDrNWnw-N6w&oe=6A19B3DD"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "294735778406481", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982510_294735781739814_4601886414751003638_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ZES8b_uNjEQ7kNvwEhN9zV&_nc_oc=AdpZ3i0MFADxRf185EW8j3PKsKWOo18g0HqrbJ7BoeNYZUwy615k9bqCEIyqAw9bZyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6svo7ntY9kGUkg3FafxppM-c8Yqyn1gk2RRVG-XUOI_g&oe=6A198E8E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OLC VR", "keywords": ["learning", "education", "360video", "development", "energy"], "long_description": "Real Learning in a Virtual World: Taking learning to the next level through the World Bank Group (WBG) - Open Learning Campus (OLC)  VR app. \n \nWBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challanges of global development. \n \nExperience next-generation interactive learning by getting a peek into the most pressing challenges - climate change, education, gender, urban development, international trade, public health, and more. Also available are on-demand resources, expert talks, data visualization, and other online courses through the Open Learning Campus (OLC) Platform.\n \nWhether you are a policymaker, development practitioner, or are curious to learn more, the WBG-OLC VR app is a place to virtually experience real-world challenges.", "short_description": "WBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challenges of global development.\n\nExperience next-generation interactive learnin